13:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm text-charcoal/70 leading-relaxed font-light","children":"Ready-to-wear sarees and unstitched suits are dispatched within 24 to 48 hours via premium express air couriers (BlueDart / Delhivery / DTDC), typically reaching major cities in 3 to 5 business days. Custom-stitched bridal ensembles take 7 to 14 days depending on hand embroidery requirements."}]
